/*!
@page designcenter-override-universe-domain How to Override the Default Universe Domain

In some cases, you may need to override the default universe domain used by the
client library. Use `AddUniverseDomainOption` when initializing the client
library to change this default.

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-start -->
For example, this will override the default universe domain for `designcenter_v1::DesignCenterClient`:

@snippet design_center_client_samples.cc set-client-universe-domain

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-end -->

*/

// <!-- inject-universe-domain-pages-start -->

/*! @page designcenter_v1::DesignCenterClient-universe-domain-snippet Override designcenter_v1::DesignCenterClient Universe Domain

@snippet google/cloud/designcenter/v1/samples/design_center_client_samples.cc set-client-universe-domain

*/
// <!-- inject-universe-domain-pages-end -->
